  ["The food level from set-health (decoded since the packet was specced, never kept)"
   "Which food is safe to eat and how long eating takes: the game's food properties"
   "The 775 attack packet and every mob tracked with its health (issue #258)"
   "A sword in hand for every fight, and armour worn through window-0 clicks into the armour slots"]
  :problem/decisions
  ["Eating is an always row at priority 0 after the escapes, done when fed (food 14 or more) or when nothing edible is held, so a hungry bot with no food goes on with the run"
   "The meal is the server's food rising; a deadline from the food's eating time, stretched by the server's slowdown, fails it :not-eaten"
   "Never eat what poisons or makes hungry, chorus fruit, suspicious stew or golden apples"
   "A fight is its own intent (:fight): the 775 attack packet, the look set a tick before, attacks 650 ms apart by the clock (a deadline on the intent), a kill when the target is gone, a ghost after 25 swings in reach, broken off under 10 health; :defend is an always row after the escapes (a hostile within 4, a creeper within 6 backed away from); the gym's :attack is an aside, never a step of a chained run"
   "Food is produced by :hunt, an always row after the meal: hungry with nothing edible, walk to the nearest cow, pig, sheep or rabbit a route reaches within 24 (48 once starving, food 6 or less), fight it, collect its meat where it fell, eat it raw; never chickens"
   "A creeper backed away from twice that stood where it was is shunned: a threat only within 3 blocks, and within 1.5 after six back-offs, so a starving bot is not kept from its walk by a creeper that never closes in (issues #69, #62, #161)"
   "The sword is the :sword always row after the armour: iron from ingots the armour leaves, else stone from cobblestone, else wood from planks, never from a log, so it takes nothing the pickaxes need; until it is made the fights are by hand"
   "Armour is put on by two window-0 clicks (pick up, put down in the armour slot) and made only from ingots spare once the portal's iron is held, with a table at hand: it never sends the bot mining or after a tree"
   "A fight for :hunt never breaks off, and fresh-kill needs its target gone: an animal does not strike back, and a starving bot under ten health that backed off made the hunt collect at a live cow, fail :not-picked-up and fight again to the end of the run (issue #178, world R2/37)"
   "A threat is judged from the floor it stands on or jumped from (combat/floor-pos), not the top of a jump: a stairs up lifting the bot a block and more at each step showed two zombies past a corner at the top of each jump only, and a fight began and ended every fourteen ticks, the stairs up preempted each time (issue #178, world R4/14)"
   "A target a fight gave up as unreachable (not strikable, no route: its engage ends done, issue #564) is recorded in :plan/given-up and not picked again for a minute while its aim stays out of reach, and :defend asks approachable? as the blaze acts do: a mob in water two blocks below was re-picked every 150 ms and the stage behind it timed out (issues #69, #62, #582, #161)"]
