   "A drop lying in a pit under the floor (a half block of pickup reach) or inside a block placed over it, stood over until the collect fails :not-picked-up (issue #500): the pit's cell is walked onto (fetch-walk), the one in stone left"
   "Hurt in the Nether with no food held: health comes back only from food 18, and a rest fails :no-heal (issue #501): the hunt row stocks provision-wanted (six) foods in the overworld, from the stone pickaxe on (before the descent, while the bot is on the surface: issue #504) and again once the portal's iron is held, and with no animal within 48 blocks searches for one on foot for two minutes (before the descent) or six (kit) at most, never from the water, and never out of a dig or a swim already begun, and never holding the run up (hunt/foraging?), and a rest that cannot heal (food under 18, nothing to eat) is held in cover, not failed, and with the portal kit held in the overworld the meal is eaten up to food 18 (eat/portal-fed), so the bot enters fed; hurt in the Nether with only rotten flesh held, the meal is the flesh (eat/scrap-held)"
